an. If you represent people, if you're a part of the government, you should put your own people first. The officials in those countries should put their own people first. I don't think that makes them racist or xenophobic at all. I think that just means that they're protecting and taking care of their people. I'm going to push back on that narrative real quick and just say that If more of our politicians actually put our own citizens first, I think we'd be in a much better spot.",
