    "turn_idx": 188,
    "turn_text": "No, you're right, man. I just actually did a post a couple of days ago. I think I put it on X, but I was talking about an IG report from the Department of Homeland Security Inspector General, and he released a report a couple months ago, and he was talking about, I mean, his report, they had found that there are seven to nine million people foreigners that got legitimate visas. They're walking around the United States of America that didn't do the in-person interview that they were supposed to in their host nation. They didn't get the local background check. They didn't get their fingerprints done. And then they got flown over here under the caveat that, you know, our security folks were going to do it here. And the only thing that was done was our security folks as their train just looked at the visa to see if, yeah, this is a legitimate visa. And so he It's not just the chaos we see at the border. There's so many other layers to it. And Ryan's point, I do believe in many ways it's intentional. I do believe some people just, I do believe there are a percentage of people that just have that do have good intentions. They just want people to have a better life. I can get that. I can sympathize and empathize with that. But at the same time, I also know that there are people with nefarious intentions and that they want people to a new group of people to come to the country that might vote for them. And I do also believe that there are people around the world, different groups that utilize and use our open border system as a way to get their operatives within the country. And it's happening left and right. I mean, all you have to do is look at, and this is like the surface layer of the onion, right? This isn't even like multiple layers down, but all you have to do is look at how many people were encountered at the southern border under Donald Trump, I think it was like 14 people like the entire time that he was president. It was definitely less than 20. And when you look at under Joe Biden with, you know, and this was a couple months ago, it was over 350. Right? And so it's just like, it's open season and everybody knows it. And yet you've got Mayorkas and Biden and the borders are Kamala Harris, you know, sitting there telling you Stone Cold, deadpan that the border is secure. And so yeah, man, it's a, it's a complete disaster. And Clark, when you talk about the military age men, Um, you know, it used to be a couple hundred, you know, uh, military age men coming in from China every year. Guess how many we've seen over the last couple of years annually over 20,000. I think, I think the last time I checked this year was like 23,000. And I'm not saying that all those guys are, you know, here to, uh, you know, uh, recavic, but I wouldn't be shocked at all if a minimum of 10% of them weren't here. Um, you know, you you know, working for the Chinese Communist Party with instructions to as soon as we push the button and say go, you guys are, you guys are to wreak as much havoc as possible. Because let's not forget, they have said publicly now for a very long time that they're going to reunify and retake Taiwan. And I wouldn't be surprised if they do it while they feel that we're weak.",
